/var/projects/toy_physics/research/pde_ledger/redteam/batches/batch_IV2_v2.md:28:Batch IV.2 covers the **outgoing-DtN spherical-Hankel fingerprint and the deformation-class robustness ledger**: from the exact `l=2` outgoing Λ-form (104) through the checkpoint chi_Q=1 derivation (105 CHECKPOINT) to the reduced 2.5PN closure (106), the general isotropic-DtN deformation algebra (107), the β-parameterized robustness submanifold (108), the linearized branch-selection law (109), the explicit Robin outlet (110), the standalone mixed side-channel pole (111), the hybrid Robin-mixed compensation law (112), and the concrete two-channel core Schur outlet (114). Stages 103 and 113 are status-only consolidation cards. Checkpoint 105 (chi_Q=1) is the load-bearing pin that Parts IV.3+ consume.
