/var/projects/toy_physics/research/pde_ledger/redteam/resolutions/batch_III5_paper_alignment.md:99:The chain is: `Omega(Pe=0) = 1` ⟹ `zeta_F1(0) = A_F1` ⟹ (`zeta_req^min = 1/3 < A_F1`) ⟹ `Pe_req = 0`. The script only verifies the third link (`zeta_min < A_F1`).
