/var/projects/toy_physics/research/pde_ledger/redteam/tmp_prompts/audit_directive_121.md:61:The script currently has only ONE `expect_zero` assertion (the tube-length relation). Four of the five paper-side boxed deliverables (the explicit closed form of `r_geom`, the existence threshold, the F1 numerical value `r_F1`, the squared `r_c^F1`) are printed but not asserted. Anchor them with explicit `expect_zero` calls.
