/var/projects/toy_physics/research/pde_ledger/redteam/tmp_prompts/audit_directive_118.md:16:For `paper_misalignment` findings (F1), do nothing — the orchestrator is holding for user resolution. Do not edit `paper/`, `notes/`, or scripts to "fix" the paper_misalignment unless the user has explicitly chosen a direction in a follow-up directive.
