/var/projects/toy_physics/research/pde_ledger/redteam/tmp_prompts/stage_006_delta_iter2.md:12:Iteration 1 applied F1 (created the missing `.wl`) and F3 (no-op informational). F2 was blocked because the original directive's required change for the **(a) bogus-projection** sub-check was mathematically null: adding `w` to `B3_bulk_proj` and then differentiating w.r.t. `z` gives 0 identically (since `w` and `z` are independent symbols).
/var/projects/toy_physics/research/pde_ledger/redteam/tmp_prompts/stage_006_delta_iter2.md:14:This delta unblocks F2 with a corrected (a) sub-check and asks you to also apply the originally-requested (b) and (c) sub-checks.
